            "question": "What does it cost, and are group rates available?",
            "answer": "<p>Pricing is listed on each training's page and varies by length and format. Reduced student rates are available for many offerings, and we offer group rates for agencies or practices enrolling several clinicians. Contact us for a group quote.</p>"
